<title>ITALY: Italian bonds/futures closing report.</title>
<headline>Italian bonds/futures closing report.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian bonds and futures ended another strong session confirming a solidity not many in the market would have bet on just a few days ago, traders said.</p>
<p>The Btp December future started cautiously but took off in the afternoon touching a high of 116.98 when it met resistance at 117.00.</p>
<p>Dealers said the market was supported by a firm lira, the good performance on other bond markets and increasing optimism over the key 1997 budget being passed without any major problems.</p>
